    "room_disposition": [
      "The get, keep and delete paths construct real shop window classes and store callbacks on their declared members. All three retain explicit allocation and the existing constructor calls. Native new expressions changed the callback address load order.",
      "The bank opener calls the native deposit constructor and uses the declared meseta, deposit and camera members. The constructor preserves the shared width calculations, selected-camera scaling and text layout.",
      "The typed meseta spend and shared safe-free and copy providers retain their original call targets. The deposit and withdraw card-window transfers keep their directions and the 0x12C0 extent.",
      "The historical operator new[] and delete[] forms call the same raw allocation and free functions. The source keeps the established mem_alloc and mem_free names and the original 0x10 array header and 200 element records.",
      "The class-name label and three constructor labels use the live named owners. The two-argument shop-message virtual slot has its established name and body."
    ],
    "gear_disposition": [
      "The relocated greeting uses the original position floats, client selection and camera mode. The active code keeps the meseta window through its declared owner.",
      "The sell window uses its native constructor with the three original pointers and selector 0x2A. Both callback stores and the state transition remain intact.",
      "The four functions moved out of the historical split are still linked at their original addresses. The active gear owner carries the confirmation values, close behavior, and quest and gear continuations."
    ]
